      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Step 1 选择输入\n\ncheckpoint\nv1.1 = EEF / v1.2 = TCP\nsim-gpus（默认 8 卡）\npolicy-port（默认 20000）\nbase-port（默认 19600）",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
