      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "N× Policy Server\n\nGPU slot i\n端口 = policy-port + i\n\nEVA-VLA：OpenPI\nXPolicyLab：优先 OpenPI 兼容\n或使用原生 xpolicylab 协议\n\nresize / crop / normalize\n在模型内部完成",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "N× Policy Server\n\nGPU slot i\n端口 = policy-port + i\n\nEVA-VLA：OpenPI\nXPolicyLab：优先 OpenPI 兼容\n或使用原生 xpolicylab 协议\n\nresize / crop / normalize\n在模型内部完成",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
