      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "N× EVA-CLIENT\n\n固定绑定同 slot 的服务与 SIM\n\n原图透传：\n[H, W, 3] uint8 / HWC\nresize = False\nconvert_bgr_to_rgb = False\n\n同步执行 + action ACK\n不额外等待关节到位",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "N× EVA-CLIENT\n\n固定绑定同 slot 的服务与 SIM\n\n原图透传：\n[H, W, 3] uint8 / HWC\nresize = False\nconvert_bgr_to_rgb = False\n\n同步执行 + action ACK\n不额外等待关节到位",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
