      "text": "N× EVA-SIM\n\nscripts/evaluation/\neval_v1.1.sh → EEF\neval_v1.2.sh → TCP\n只拉起 SIM + Client\n\nlockstep / 动作 ACK\n判断成功、录制轨迹与视频",
